 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "text": "Contract: three asset types in asset-types.json — typography, density, component-sizing — with JSON schemas, validators (ts + mjs), fixtures; design-package/style-package accept them as slots; open registries so later pieces add fields, never types",
   "model": "Fable",
   "estimate": "30 min",
   "estimateMin": 30,
   "startedAt": "",
   "doneAt": "2026-10-31T00:37:05.077Z",
   "actualMin": 0,
   "done": true
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "text": "Engine + live sync: compile the three types to --fx-* tokens (TS reference engine, fixtures, hot-swap), add them to the shared look on axHub so a change reaches every app live; PORTING.md records Kotlin twins as deferred",
   "model": "Fable",
   "estimate": "30 min",
   "estimateMin": 30,
   "startedAt": "2026-10-31T00:37:05.077Z",
   "doneAt": "2026-10-31T00:37:05.128Z",
   "actualMin": 0,
   "done": true
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "text": "Adopt: axf.css (incl. the Oct 30 compact block), settings library, console.css, framework React components and libs (incl. framework/libs/mcp pages) read only the new tokens — no sizes decided in code",
   "model": "Opus",
   "estimate": "30 min",
   "estimateMin": 30,
   "startedAt": "2026-10-31T00:37:05.128Z",
   "doneAt": "2026-10-31T09:07:21.860Z",
   "actualMin": 510,
   "done": true
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "text": "Plugins: per-plugin sizes that duplicate a shared piece switch to the new tokens (all plugins); starter assets (compact = Oct 30 look, standard, roomy) for each type; design packages reference them; Settings → Appearance gets the three pickers",
   "model": "Opus",
   "estimate": "30 min",
   "estimateMin": 30,
   "startedAt": "2026-10-31T09:07:21.860Z",
   "doneAt": "2026-10-31T09:07:21.935Z",
   "actualMin": 0,
   "done": true
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "text": "Checks (check-theme flags hard-coded sizes; theme-swap swaps the three types), re-bake every app once (Patches paused), before/after screenshots, report + LOG, PR",
   "model": "Opus",
